aditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"尽","pinyin":"jǐn","traditional":"盡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìng","traditional":"性","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"赞","pinyin":"zàn","traditional":"贊","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dì","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huà","traditional":"化","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"育","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"赞","pinyin":"zàn","traditional":"贊","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dì","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huà","traditional":"化","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"育","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yǔ","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dì","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"参","pinyin":"cān","traditional":"參","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Hanya orang yang telah mencapai puncak Iman di dunia ini, dapat sempurna mengembangkan Watak Sejatinya. Karena dapat sempurna mengembangkan Watak Sejatinya, maka dapat membantu mengembangkan Watak Sejati orang lain; karena dapat membantu mengembangkan Watak Sejati orang lain, maka akan dapat pula membantu mengembangkan Watak Sejati segenap wujud; karena dapat membantu mengembangkan Watak Sejati segenap wujud, maka dapat membantu langit dan bumi menyelenggarakan peleburan dan pengembangan; karena dapat membantu langit dan bumi menyelenggarakan peleburan dan pengembangan, maka menjadi tritunggal dengan langit dan bumi. (Shu Jing - Su King IV. 4.2). TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XXII (Yang Tingkat ke Dua)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/22 - Bab XXI - Yang Mencapai Puncak Iman.md","title":"Bab XXI — Yang Mencapai Puncak Iman"}
